{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42541638/934c9f5db4fc633938c72b52569bb2dab4112a0a.png

We are pleased to inform you about the opening of a new game world - "Kainen"! For the first time in a long time, you have the opportunity to start the game on an equal footing with everyone else, on a new server with a pristine economy!

Beginners and battle-savvy warriors alike will be able to start their journey in Rappelz from scratch, fighting side by side with monsters, teaming up and competing for a place on the leaderboard!

What to eat on Kainen:

 fun with players of your level;
 party-kach in the dungeons, as once;
 a lot of people in the starting locations;
 a pleasant wind of nostalgia.


What is not on Kainen:

 established tops;
 “folders” that will prevent you from downloading;
 high-level pets (and tamed pets in general!);
 inflation;

The Kainen server works according to the PvP model.

Level up and get the best equipment first on the server, create powerful guilds, fight for dominance at the entrance to the Cursed Temple and the right to own the dungeon!

We wish everyone who decides to start their adventures in the new game world "Kinen" success and heroic victories!

